:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;word-wrap:normal" class="c-lcEjxv">Define criteria for your jobs and use AI to analyze matches against that criteria across inbound applications.</p></th><td class="c-boMPVq"><span aria-label="Included" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-cHZnbS-inline-true c-fvJrVK-kWpDfM-size-1 c-fvJrVK-iuRhHE-css"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 512a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 1 1 0 512zM374 145.7c-10.7-7.8-25.7-5.4-33.5 5.3L221.1 315.2 169 263.1c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0s-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l72 72c5 5 11.8 7.5 18.8 7s13.4-4.1 17.5-9.8L379.3 179.2c7.8-10.7 5.4-25.7-5.3-33.5z"></path></svg></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span aria-label="Included" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-cHZnbS-inline-true c-fvJrVK-kWpDfM-size-1 c-fvJrVK-iuRhHE-css"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 512a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 1 1 0 512zM374 145.7c-10.7-7.8-25.7-5.4-33.5 5.3L221.1 315.2 169 263.1c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0s-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l72 72c5 5 11.8 7.5 18.8 7s13.4-4.1 17.5-9.8L379.3 179.2c7.8-10.7 5.4-25.7-5.3-33.5z"></path></svg></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span aria-label="Included" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-cHZnbS-inline-true c-fvJrVK-kWpDfM-size-1 c-fvJrVK-iuRhHE-css"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 512a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 1 1 0 512zM374 145.7c-10.7-7.8-25.7-5.4-33.5 5.3L221.1 315.2 169 263.1c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0s-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l72 72c5 5 11.8 7.5 18.8 7s13.4-4.1 17.5-9.8L379.3 179.2c7.8-10.7 5.4-25.7-5.3-33.5z"></path></svg></span></td></tr><tr class="c-liGZFs"><th scope="row" class="c-gMhLWL"><span tabindex="0" data-state="closed" class="c-fRWQiy c-fRWQiy-kMBHLg-hasInfo-true">Candidate Reviews</span><p style="position:absolute;border:0;width:1