" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 512a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 1 1 0 512zM374 145.7c-10.7-7.8-25.7-5.4-33.5 5.3L221.1 315.2 169 263.1c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0s-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l72 72c5 5 11.8 7.5 18.8 7s13.4-4.1 17.5-9.8L379.3 179.2c7.8-10.7 5.4-25.7-5.3-33.5z"></path></svg></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span aria-label="Included" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-cHZnbS-inline-true c-fvJrVK-kWpDfM-size-1 c-fvJrVK-iuRhHE-css"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 512a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 1 1 0 512zM374 145.7c-10.7-7.8-25.7-5.4-33.5 5.3L221.1 315.2 169 263.1c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0s-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l72 72c5 5 11.8 7.5 18.8 7s13.4-4.1 17.5-9.8L379.3 179.2c7.8-10.7 5.4-25.7-5.3-33.5z"></path></svg></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span aria-label="Included" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-cHZnbS-inline-true c-fvJrVK-kWpDfM-size-1 c-fvJrVK-iuRhHE-css"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 512a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 1 1 0 512zM374 145.7c-10.7-7.8-25.7-5.4-33.5 5.3L221.1 315.2 169 263.1c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0s-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l72 72c5 5 11.8 7.5 18.8 7s13.4-4.1 17.5-9.8L379.3 179.2c7.8-10.7 5.4-25.7-5.3-33.5z"></path></svg></span></td></tr><tr class="c-liGZFs"><th scope="row" class="c-gMhLWL"><span tabindex="0" data-state="closed" class="c-fRWQiy c-fRWQiy-kMBHLg-hasInfo-true">Candidate Texting (SMS)</span><p style="position:absolute;border:0;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;word-wrap:normal" class="c-lcEjxv">Sends two-way SMS to US and Canada candidates from a shared company number, with templates, automation, and consent handling.</p></th><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">1,000 outbound msgs per month</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">2,000 outbound msg per seat per year</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">3,000 outbound msgs per seat per year</span></span></td></tr><tr class="c-liGZFs"><th scope="row" class="c-gMhLWL"><span tabindex="0" data-state="closed" class="c-fRWQiy c-fRWQiy-kMBHLg-hasInfo-true">Candidate Texting additional messages</span><p style="position:absolute;border:0;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;word-wrap:normal" class="c-lcEjxv">Adds more SMS messages for purchase as needed in batches.</p></th><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">$90 per 1,000			</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">$90 per 1,000			</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">$90 per 1,000			</span></span></td></tr><tr class="c-liGZFs"><th scope="row" class="c-gMhLWL"><span tabindex="0" data-state="closed" class="c-fRWQiy c-fRWQiy-kMBHLg-hasInfo-true">Customizable Candidate Experience Surveys</span><p style="position:absolute;border:0;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;word-wrap:normal" class="c-lcEjxv">Builds candidate feedback surveys with NPS and linear rating questions, sent manually or by stage-based automation.</p></th><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">Limited to 1 Survey</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">Custom, Unlimited</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span cla