dding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;word-wrap:normal" class="c-lcEjxv">Places [HOLD] events on interviewer calendars without sending invites to the candidate, silently or with notification.</p></th><td class="c-boMPVq"><span aria-label="Not included" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-cHZnbS-inline-true c-fvJrVK-kWpDfM-size-1 c-fvJrVK-iknCAuN-css"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11.7816 4.03157C12.0062 3.80702 12.0062 3.44295 11.7816 3.2184C11.5571 2.99385 11.193 2.99385 10.9685 3.2184L7.50005 6.68682L4.03164 3.2184C3.80708 2.99385 3.44301 2.99385 3.21846 3.2184C2.99391 3.44295 2.99391 3.80702 3.21846 4.03157L6.68688 7.49999L3.21846 10.9684C2.99391 11.193 2.99391 11.557 3.21846 11.7816C3.44301 12.0061 3.80708 12.0061 4.03164 11.7816L7.50005 8.31316L10.9685 11.7816C11.193 12.0061 11.5571 12.0061 11.7816 11.7816C12.0062 11.557 12.0062 11.193 11.7816 10.9684L8.31322 7.49999L11.7816 4.03157Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">Adv. Scheduling Add-On</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span aria-label="Included" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-cHZnbS-inline-true c-fvJrVK-kWpDfM-size-1 c-fvJrVK-iuRhHE-css"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 512a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 1 1 0 512zM374 145.7c-10.7-7.8-25.7-5.4-33.5 5.3L221.1 315.2 169 263.1c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0s-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l72 72c5 5 11.8 7.5 18.8 7s13.4-4.1 17.5-9.8L379.3 179.2c7.8-10.7 5.4-25.7-5.3-33.5z"></path></svg></span></td></tr><tr class="c-liGZFs"><th scope="row" class="c-gMhLWL"><span tabindex="0" data-state="closed" class="c-fRWQiy c-fRWQiy-kMBHLg-hasInfo-true">Automated Interviewer Training</span><p style="position:absolute;border:0;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;word-wrap:normal" class="c-lcEjxv">Tracks shadow and reverse-shadow interviews automatically and promotes trainees to the qualified pool once requirements are met.</p></th><td class="c-boMPVq"><span aria-label="Not included" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-cHZnbS-inline-true c-fvJrVK-kWpDfM-size-1 c-fvJrVK-iknCAuN-css"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11.7816 4.03157C12.0062 3.80702 12.0062 3.44295 11.7816 3.2184C11.5571 2.99385 11.193 2.99385 10.9685 3.2184L7.50005 6.68682L4.03164 3.2184C3.80708 2.99385 3.44301 2.99385 3.21846 3.2184C2.99391 3.44295 2.99391 3.80702 3.21846 4.03157L6.68688 7.49999L3.21846 10.9684C2.99391 11.193 2.99391 11.557 3.21846 11.7816C3.44301 12.0061 3.80708 12.0061 4.03164 11.7816L7.50005 8.31316L10.9685 11.7816C11.193 12.0061 11.5571 12.0061 11.7816 11.7816C12.0062 11.557 12.0062 11.193 11.7816 10.9684L8.31322 7.49999L11.7816 4.03157Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">Adv. Scheduling Add-On</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span aria-label="Included" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-cHZnbS-inline-true c-fvJrVK-kWpDfM-size-1 c-fvJrVK-iuRhHE-css"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 512a256 256 0 1 1 0-512 256 256 0 1 1 0 512zM374 145.7c-10.7-7.8-25.7-5.4-33.5 5.3L221.1 315.2 169 263.1c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0s-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l72 72c5 5 11.8 7.5 18.8 7s13.4-4.1 17.5-9.8L379.3 179.2c7.8-10.7 5.4-25.7-5.3-33.5z"></path></svg></span></td></tr><tr class="c-liGZFs"><th scope="row" class="c-gMhLWL"><span tabindex="0" data-state="closed" class="c-fRWQiy c-fRWQiy-kMBHLg-hasInfo-true">Auto Replace Declined Interviewer</span><p style="position:absolute;border:0;width:1px;he