sisted application review, candidate fraud detection, and AI talent rediscovery.</p></th><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">1,500 credits per mo.</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">2,500 credits per seat per year</span></span></td><td class="c-boMPVq"><span class="c-LrTUv"><span class="c-PJLV c-KxQAN c-KxQAN-cBLpOj-size-2 c-PJLV-iiaMOGV-css">12,500 credits per seat per year</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-exqJMq-size-1"><div class="c-durDQG c-PJLV c-PJLV-dzcdLJ-size-default"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-kJJwbO-spacing-7"><h2 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-kUwYuk-size-6">Add-ons</h2><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-gHgbiV-size-4">Optional add-ons for capabilities beyond the core platform</p><div class="c-hyTftA c-hyTftA-dCpVsf-spacing-6 c-hyTftA-icVnKHJ-css"><div style="opacity:0;will-change:transform,opacity;transform:translateY(8%)" class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-kJJwbO-spacing-7 c-PJLV-icxfUmi-css"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-eKWVTQ-spacing-5 c-PJLV-ibVmQYH-css"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-eKWVTQ-spacing-5"><div class="c-PJLV c-iSwBqf c-PJLV-fVlWzK-spacing-3 c-iSwBqf-jroWjL-align-center"><span class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-hFitLN-size-4"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%278